.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Claude Code — personal overrides only.
# .claude/skills/ and .claude/commands/ are OpenSpec-generated team config
# (regenerated by `openspec update`) and ARE committed.
.claude/settings.local.json


# Added by cargo

/target

# devcroft's own generated service artifacts, if a sandbox is ever brought
# up against this repo itself: `up` writes the process-compose config, its
# log, and its unix socket here (see src/services/mod.rs — the project root
# is the only place the sandbox can both write and read).
#
# Unanchored on purpose, unlike `/target` above: a sandbox can be brought up
# against any sample too, and each would otherwise need its own copy of this
# rule.
.devcroft/

# What a remote editor unpacks into whatever project it connects to
# (docs/ssh-validation.md's matrix is exercised against the samples, not
# against a fixed one). Global for the same reason `.devcroft/` is: it is a
# property of connecting an editor, not of any one project.
.vscode-server/

# Everything else per-sample: each `samples/*/.gitignore` covers its own
# toolchain's build output and the caches devcroft redirects into the
# project root (`.cargo`, `.rustup`, `.go`, `.gocache`, `.gradle`), anchored
# with a leading `/` so a rule cannot reach outside the sample that declares
# it.
